{title: Way Maker}
{artist: Sinach}
{key: E}
{capo: 0}

{start_of_chorus}
[E]Way maker, [B]miracle worker
[C#m]Promise keeper, [A]light in the darkness
[E/G#]My God, [A]that is who You [B]are
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
[E]You are here, [B]touching every heart
[C#m]I worship You, [A]I worship You
